OL,3,ANetanyahu names 'hero' pilot attacked
OL,4,Aon flight as passengers arrive back in
OL,5,AIsrael
OL,6,
OL,7,FIsraeli PM Benjamin Netanyahu names the
OL,8,F"hero" pilot who was stabbed by his
OL,9,Fco-pilot on an Israel-bound Flydubai
OL,10,Fflight
OL,12,FCaptain Smit Machchhar, an Indian
OL,13,Fnational, displayed "extraordinary
OL,14,Fbravery" by fighting back and
OL,15,Fpreventing a mid-air disaster, the PM
OL,16,Fwrites on X
OL,18,FThe plane was travelling from Dubai to
OL,19,FTel Aviv when it plummeted 17,000ft
OL,20,F(5,200m) in less than two minutes,
OL,21,Fbefore being diverted to Saudi Arabia
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
