OL,3,ANetanyahu names 'hero' pilot attacked
OL,4,Aon flight as passengers arrive back in
OL,5,AIsrael
OL,6,
OL,7,FPassengers have now arrived in Israel -
OL,8,Fone man, still wearing a blood-stained
OL,9,FT-shirt, tells Netanyahu how he helped
OL,10,Fstop the attack
OL,12,FEarlier, a passenger reported "terrible
OL,13,Fscreams throughout the plane" before
OL,14,F"three to five guys burst into the
OL,15,Fcockpit" and subdued the attacker
OL,17,FAnother passenger said "we took control
OL,18,Fof the flight" from "an assailant with
OL,19,Fa knife" - meanwhile, two other pilots,
OL,20,Fsitting at the back, reportedly came
OL,21,Fforward to land the plane
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
